("Define photosynthesis and write its equation.", "Food making by plants; carbon dioxide + water gives glucose + oxygen in sunlight with chlorophyll."),
("How do we know oxygen is released in photosynthesis?", "Gas from a sunlit water plant relights/intensifies a matchstick flame."),
("What are stomata?", "Tiny pores on leaves for gas exchange."),
("Differentiate xylem and phloem.", "Xylem carries water and minerals up; phloem carries food from leaves to all parts."),
("Do plants respire? How do you show it?", "Yes; germinating seeds turn lime water milky because they release carbon dioxide."),
("Write the equation of respiration.", "Glucose + oxygen gives carbon dioxide + water + energy."),
